Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

SigmaForge builds on the following projects, which remain under their own
licenses. This file is an attribution notice, not a re-license.

* pySigma (LGPL-2.1) - Sigma rule parsing and the backend/pipeline
  framework used for conversion.
  https://github.com/SigmaHQ/pySigma

* pySigma-backend-elasticsearch (LGPL-2.1) - Lucene / Elasticsearch query
  backend.
  https://github.com/SigmaHQ/pySigma-backend-elasticsearch

* pySigma-pipeline-windows and pySigma-pipeline-sysmon (LGPL-2.1) - field
  mapping pipelines for Windows and Sysmon telemetry.
  https://github.com/SigmaHQ/pySigma-pipeline-windows
  https://github.com/SigmaHQ/pySigma-pipeline-sysmon

* elasticsearch-py (Apache-2.0) - Elasticsearch client used by the
  integration tests and the deploy script.
  https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch-py

pySigma and its backends are used as unmodified libraries, imported at
runtime. SigmaForge's own source is not a derivative work of them.

